    "html": "<p>For a Carnot engine with an efficiency of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50\"></span>,  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T_{\\textup{c}} = 100\\:\\textup{K}\"></span>, where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T_{\\textup{c}}\"></span> is the temperature at which heat leaves the engine. </p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T_{\\textup{h}}\"></span>, the temperature at which heat is transferred into the engine?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"400\\:\\textup{K}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"200\\:\\textup{K}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\\:\\textup{K}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\:\\textup{K}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
